{"id": 1869, "title": "Tiger", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "tiger", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1869_tiger.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["有两只老虎，一只在笼子里，一只在森林里。在笼子里的老虎很安逸，在森林里的老虎很自由。两只老虎经常一起聊天，笼子里的老虎总是羡慕森林里老虎的自由，森林里的老虎却羡慕笼子里老虎的安逸。", "一天，一只老虎对另一只老虎说：“咱们换一换，怎么样？”另一只老虎同意了。于是，笼子里的老虎走进了大自然，森林里的老虎走进了笼子。从笼子里走出的老虎很高兴，在森林里拼命地奔跑；走进笼子的老虎也十分快乐，他再也不用为食物而发愁。", "但不久，两只老虎都死了。一只老虎饥饿而死，另一只忧郁而亡。从笼子里走出的老虎获得了自由，却没有获得捕食的本领；走进笼子的老虎获得了安逸，却没有获得在狭小空间生活的心境。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["有兩隻老虎，一隻在籠子裡，一隻在森林裡。在籠子裡的老虎很安逸，在森林裡的老虎很自由。兩隻老虎經常一起聊天，籠子裡的老虎總是羨慕森林裡老虎的自由，森林裡的老虎卻羨慕籠子裡老虎的安逸。", "一天，一隻老虎對另一隻老虎說：“咱們換一換，怎麼樣？”另一隻老虎同意了。於是，籠子裡的老虎走進了大自然，森林裡的老虎走進了籠子。從籠子裡走出的老虎很高興，在森林裡拼命地奔跑；走進籠子的老虎也十分快樂，他再也不用為食物而發愁。", "但不久，兩隻老虎都死了。一隻老虎飢餓而死，另一隻憂鬱而亡。從籠子裡走出的老虎獲得了自由，卻沒有獲得捕食的本領；走進籠子的老虎獲得了安逸，卻沒有獲得在狹小空間生活的心境。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yǒu liǎng zhī lǎo hǔ， yī zhī zài lóng zi lǐ， yī zhī zài sēn lín lǐ。 zài lóng zi lǐ de lǎo hǔ hěn ān yì， zài sēn lín lǐ de lǎo hǔ hěn zì yóu。 liǎng zhī lǎo hǔ jīng cháng yī qǐ liáo tiān， lóng zi lǐ de lǎo hǔ zǒng shì xiàn mù sēn lín lǐ lǎo hǔ de zì yóu， sēn lín lǐ de lǎo hǔ què xiàn mù lóng zi lǐ lǎo hǔ de ān yì。", "yī tiān， yī zhī lǎo hǔ duì lìng yī zhī lǎo hǔ shuō：“ zán men huàn yī huàn， zěn me yàng？” lìng yī zhī lǎo hǔ tóng yì le。 yú shì， lóng zi lǐ de lǎo hǔ zǒu jìn le dà zì rán， sēn lín lǐ de lǎo hǔ zǒu jìn le lóng zi。 cóng lóng zi lǐ zǒu chū de lǎo hǔ hěn gāo xìng， zài sēn lín lǐ pīn mìng de bēn pǎo； zǒu jìn lóng zi de lǎo hǔ yě shí fēn kuài lè， tā zài yě bù yòng wèi shí wù ér fā chóu。", "dàn bù jiǔ， liǎng zhī lǎo hǔ dōu sǐ le。 yī zhī lǎo hǔ jī è ér sǐ， lìng yī zhī yōu yù ér wáng。 cóng lóng zi lǐ zǒu chū de lǎo hǔ huò dé le zì yóu， què méi yǒu huò dé bǔ shí de běn lǐng； zǒu jìn lóng zi de lǎo hǔ huò dé le ān yì， què méi yǒu huò dé zài xiá xiǎo kōng jiān shēng huó de xīn jìng。"], "english_paragraphs": ["There were two tigers: one lived in a cage, and the other lived in a forest. The tiger in the cage had a comfortable life, while the tiger in the forest was free. They often talked to each other. The caged tiger always envied the forest tiger’s freedom, but the forest tiger envied the caged tiger’s comfort.", "One day, one tiger said to the other, “How about we trade places?” The other tiger agreed. So the caged tiger went out into the wild, and the forest tiger entered the cage. The tiger who had left the cage was delighted and ran as fast as he could through the forest. The tiger who had entered the cage was happy too: he no longer had to worry about finding food.", "But before long, both tigers were dead. One starved to death, and the other died of despair. The tiger who left the cage had gained freedom but had never learned how to hunt. The tiger who entered the cage had gained comfort but could not bear living in such a small space."], "english_full": "There were two tigers: one lived in a cage, and the other lived in a forest. The tiger in the cage had a comfortable life, while the tiger in the forest was free. They often talked to each other. The caged tiger always envied the forest tiger’s freedom, but the forest tiger envied the caged tiger’s comfort.\n\nOne day, one tiger said to the other, “How about we trade places?” The other tiger agreed. So the caged tiger went out into the wild, and the forest tiger entered the cage. The tiger who had left the cage was delighted and ran as fast as he could through the forest. The tiger who had entered the cage was happy too: he no longer had to worry about finding food.\n\nBut before long, both tigers were dead. One starved to death, and the other died of despair. The tiger who left the cage had gained freedom but had never learned how to hunt. The tiger who entered the cage had gained comfort but could not bear living in such a small space.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī\" data-defn=\"classifier for birds and certain animals, one of a pair, some utensils, vessels etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">隻</span><rt>zhī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo hǔ\" data-defn=\"tiger\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">老虎</span><span class=\"tr\">老虎</span><rt>lǎo hǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī\" data-defn=\"classifier for birds and certain animals, one of a pair, some utensils, vessels etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">隻</span><rt>zhī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lóng zi\" data-defn=\"cage; basket; container\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">笼子</span><span class=\"tr\">籠子</span><rt>lóng zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǐ\" data-defn=\"lining / interior / inside\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裡</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī\" data-defn=\"classifier for birds and certain animals, one of a pair, some utensils, vessels etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">隻</span><rt>zhī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><spa